(5532404, 798383, 51638, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but without the classic blur to the background it''s hard to tell if the shot was panned or not.</td>', 'Great shot, but without the classic blur to the background it''s hard to tell if the shot was panned or not.', '2009-06-17 01:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
