(5532438, 799936, 51638, '<td valign="top">I suspect you have confused the blur in the background due to DOF with the blur created by motion panning. Two different things I''m afraid.</td>', 'I suspect you have confused the blur in the background due to DOF with the blur created by motion panning. Two different things I''m afraid.', '2009-06-17 01:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
