(5532584, 799861, 63812, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but I think, if the main subject were not so centered, this image would be more balanced and interesting. Any way...good!</td>', 'Nice capture, but I think, if the main subject were not so centered, this image would be more balanced and interesting. Any way...good!', '2009-06-17 02:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
