(5532677, 799715, 11089, '<td valign="top">A good expression of movement. However, I find it a bit confusing the low right-&gt;up left direction. Horizontal placement or a mirrored image would have been more expressive, IMO. Nevertheless, I reckon that this is the picture in this challenge that conveys the best the sensation of movement without depicting an overused interpretation.</td>', 'A good expression of movement. However, I find it a bit confusing the low right->up left direction. Horizontal placement or a mirrored image would have been more expressive, IMO. Nevertheless, I reckon that this is the picture in this challenge that conveys the best the sensation of movement without depicting an overused interpretation.', '2009-06-17 04:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532739, 799593, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice panning ... great colour car as well</td>', 'Nice panning ... great colour car as well', '2009-06-17 06:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
