(5532773, 799593, 5034, '<td valign="top">Nah, radical would have been 1/60th.  But a good panning shot, well done.</td>', 'Nah, radical would have been 1/60th.  But a good panning shot, well done.', '2009-06-17 07:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532830, 798332, 67258, '<td valign="top">A tricky subject to pan, but you got it.  In an ideal world you would have moved the car before taking the picture and caught the whole of the tyre and leg, but you have captured the sense of fun, and something of a sense of sponteneity, too.  I wonder if slightly tighter framing and a tilt would add a bit more dynamism?</td>', 'A tricky subject to pan, but you got it.  In an ideal world you would have moved the car before taking the picture and caught the whole of the tyre and leg, but you have captured the sense of fun, and something of a sense of sponteneity, too.  I wonder if slightly tighter framing and a tilt would add a bit more dynamism?', '2009-06-17 08:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532835, 799732, 67258, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t really work for me.  I suspect that this may have been your first attempt at panning - it is a difficult technique to master, and I am not really there yet myself, either.  A faster moving subject, or a slower shutter speed and longer distance of panning with the shutter open would give a more noticably blurred ''speed streaked'' background.</td>', 'This one doesn''t really work for me.  I suspect that this may have been your first attempt at panning - it is a difficult technique to master, and I am not really there yet myself, either.  A faster moving subject, or a slower shutter speed and longer distance of panning with the shutter open would give a more noticably blurred ''speed streaked'' background.', '2009-06-17 08:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532838, 799154, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the dynamism the vibrant colours and the tilt give to this image, and the panning technique is competently handled.  That said, there isn''t enough about the image for me to give a higher vote than 6.</td>', 'I like the dynamism the vibrant colours and the tilt give to this image, and the panning technique is competently handled.  That said, there isn''t enough about the image for me to give a higher vote than 6.', '2009-06-17 08:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532845, 799936, 8367, '<td valign="top">text/date</td>', 'text/date', '2009-06-17 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532851, 799779, 67258, '<td valign="top">First thoughts - an aesthetically interesting image with no discernable subject other than indeterminate shapes and tones, created by a less than obvious camera technique.  Is any of that of any consequence? - other than the aesthetic appeal, not at all. The image provokes in me a sense of...I can''t really articulate it, a sort of sense of ''being'' - it somehow depicts a whole bundle of very personal emotions.  I guess what I am saying is that an abstract image such as this is what it is perceived as to it''s creator and to each viewer; each will take from it something completely different and governed by their own experiences and psychology.  For me, it works extremely well.</td>', 'First thoughts - an aesthetically interesting image with no discernable subject other than indeterminate shapes and tones, created by a less than obvious camera technique.  Is any of that of any consequence? - other than the aesthetic appeal, not at all. The image provokes in me a sense of...I can''t really articulate it, a sort of sense of ''being'' - it somehow depicts a whole bundle of very personal emotions.  I guess what I am saying is that an abstract image such as this is what it is perceived as to it''s creator and to each viewer; each will take from it something completely different and governed by their own experiences and psychology.  For me, it works extremely well.', '2009-06-17 08:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532855, 798517, 67258, '<td valign="top">This would have worked well for the car advert challenge.  Bright, sunny, vibrant, with good panning technique - a solid commercial type shot.</td>', 'This would have worked well for the car advert challenge.  Bright, sunny, vibrant, with good panning technique - a solid commercial type shot.', '2009-06-17 08:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532860, 798657, 67258, '<td valign="top">People and animals are really hard to pan well, certainly much harder than a solid unbending vehicle!  You have made a good attempt at this - I wonder if the woman was skating into the light, with her shadow chasing her, rather than the other way round, if that might have produced a stronger image?  The long ''speed streaks'' work well, and you certainly get credit for that.</td>', 'People and animals are really hard to pan well, certainly much harder than a solid unbending vehicle!  You have made a good attempt at this - I wonder if the woman was skating into the light, with her shadow chasing her, rather than the other way round, if that might have produced a stronger image?  The long ''speed streaks'' work well, and you certainly get credit for that.', '2009-06-17 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532882, 799892, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice old car, but too bad there isn''t more motion blur to separate it from its background.</td>', 'Nice old car, but too bad there isn''t more motion blur to separate it from its background.', '2009-06-17 09:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532885, 799861, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  She stands out from her background very well.</td>', 'Nice shot.  She stands out from her background very well.', '2009-06-17 09:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532886, 798598, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very graceful.</td>', 'Very graceful.', '2009-06-17 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532887, 798475, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very colorful with those markings on the road.</td>', 'Very colorful with those markings on the road.', '2009-06-17 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
