(5532979, 799489, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  It needs a longer shutter speed to really catch the motion panning.  I don''t feel heading into the sun helped you in this case.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  It needs a longer shutter speed to really catch the motion panning.  I don''t feel heading into the sun helped you in this case.', '2009-06-17 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
