(5532992, 799580, 39429, '<td valign="top">I see some motion here.  A longer shutter speed to provide more motion would have provided a stronger image for me.  The composition is rather bland, also and may have been improved by cropping some of the left and front<br/> <br/>I like the stack objects on the bike.</td>', 'I see some motion here.  A longer shutter speed to provide more motion would have provided a stronger image for me.  The composition is rather bland, also and may have been improved by cropping some of the left and front I like the stack objects on the bike.', '2009-06-17 10:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532995, 798266, 39429, '<td valign="top">The night light adds to the shot.  The focus on the car could be improved.  Overall, a nice shot.</td>', 'The night light adds to the shot.  The focus on the car could be improved.  Overall, a nice shot.', '2009-06-17 10:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5532996, 799905, 39429, '<td valign="top">The child''s expression is fun.  You are showing motion panning.  The composition could be improved.</td>', 'The child''s expression is fun.  You are showing motion panning.  The composition could be improved.', '2009-06-17 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533000, 799106, 39429, '<td valign="top">I see little tale-tale streaking that indicates motion panning.  This looks more like stopped motion.<br/> <br/>The composition is interesting, but the focus just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I see little tale-tale streaking that indicates motion panning.  This looks more like stopped motion. The composition is interesting, but the focus just doesn''t work for me.', '2009-06-17 10:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533002, 799729, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love the capture of this moment in time.  The processing doesn''t work for me, and I see little to no tale-tale streaks that indicate motion panning.  This looks more like stopped motion except for the trees.  This tells me your shutter speed was too short to look like motion panning.</td>', 'I love the capture of this moment in time.  The processing doesn''t work for me, and I see little to no tale-tale streaks that indicate motion panning.  This looks more like stopped motion except for the trees.  This tells me your shutter speed was too short to look like motion panning.', '2009-06-17 10:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533004, 800039, 39429, '<td valign="top">Well panned.  Unfortunately, the composition is rather bland.</td>', 'Well panned.  Unfortunately, the composition is rather bland.', '2009-06-17 10:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533006, 799986, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.  The actual panning to gain focus on the man didn''t work for you and the composition is bland.</td>', 'Interesting capture.  The actual panning to gain focus on the man didn''t work for you and the composition is bland.', '2009-06-17 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533010, 799670, 39429, '<td valign="top">You really took some risk with this longer shutter speed.  I really like the longer panning streaks, however it stopped you from capturing Lenny with any detail to take it from nice to spectacular.</td>', 'You really took some risk with this longer shutter speed.  I really like the longer panning streaks, however it stopped you from capturing Lenny with any detail to take it from nice to spectacular.', '2009-06-17 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
