(5534775, 799826, 102019, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the trees in this, but wish the focal point was a bit larger or took up more of the photo frame.  Maybe if the car had driven closer to you it would be better for me.</td>', 'I like the effect of the trees in this, but wish the focal point was a bit larger or took up more of the photo frame.  Maybe if the car had driven closer to you it would be better for me.', '2009-06-18 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
