(5534822, 799383, 102019, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I like how you created the illusion of movement but still was able to keep the tree in focus.  Brilliant interpretation of "motion panning".  You thought outside the box and the unique point of view paid off.  Well done!  My only negative comment is the sun spot is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I like how you created the illusion of movement but still was able to keep the tree in focus.  Brilliant interpretation of "motion panning".  You thought outside the box and the unique point of view paid off.  Well done!  My only negative comment is the sun spot is a bit distracting.', '2009-06-18 11:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
