(5537185, 799779, 61396, '<td valign="top">Stop it! You make traffic jams as people must stop here to decipher and appreciate.</td>', 'Stop it! You make traffic jams as people must stop here to decipher and appreciate.', '2009-06-20 08:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537246, 798383, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I can''t vote on this one, because, without the background, there''s no way that I can tell if this was done with panning or just a fast shutter speed.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I can''t vote on this one, because, without the background, there''s no way that I can tell if this was done with panning or just a fast shutter speed.', '2009-06-20 09:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537268, 799594, 93756, '<td valign="top">This is very cool!  Love how the green and light streaks come at you.</td>', 'This is very cool!  Love how the green and light streaks come at you.', '2009-06-20 10:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537269, 799383, 93756, '<td valign="top">You''ll get marked down for this not being motion panning but the end result is very cool. I like it.</td>', 'You''ll get marked down for this not being motion panning but the end result is very cool. I like it.', '2009-06-20 10:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537372, 799300, 102019, '<td valign="top">For me this doesn''t meet the challenge because motion panning isn''t just moving the camera, it''s moving the camera WITH a moving object, so that the moving object is in focus and the background, non-moving objects, are blurred.</td>', 'For me this doesn''t meet the challenge because motion panning isn''t just moving the camera, it''s moving the camera WITH a moving object, so that the moving object is in focus and the background, non-moving objects, are blurred.', '2009-06-20 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537373, 799747, 102019, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really motion panning... It''s just moving the camera around to produce pretty lights.  Motion panning is when your camera is following a moving object, so the moving object looks clear and in focus, but the rest of the picture, the part that is NOT moving, looks blurred.</td>', 'This isn''t really motion panning... It''s just moving the camera around to produce pretty lights.  Motion panning is when your camera is following a moving object, so the moving object looks clear and in focus, but the rest of the picture, the part that is NOT moving, looks blurred.', '2009-06-20 12:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537374, 799779, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any motion panning -- something is supposed to be in focus, and I see nothing distinguishable.  I don''t even like it as an abstract.  Sorry, not a fan.</td>', 'I don''t see any motion panning -- something is supposed to be in focus, and I see nothing distinguishable.  I don''t even like it as an abstract.  Sorry, not a fan.', '2009-06-20 12:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537375, 799594, 102019, '<td valign="top">This isn''t motion panning.  Panning is when the camera is moving with a MOVING object, not a stationary one.  The idea is to have the moving object in focus, but everything AROUND it to be blurred.  Anyway, even if you met the challenge for me, I''m still not a fan of the shot.  Sorry :(</td>', 'This isn''t motion panning.  Panning is when the camera is moving with a MOVING object, not a stationary one.  The idea is to have the moving object in focus, but everything AROUND it to be blurred.  Anyway, even if you met the challenge for me, I''m still not a fan of the shot.  Sorry :(', '2009-06-20 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537376, 799936, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the motion panning.  Was the horse moving? I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t see the motion panning.  Was the horse moving? I don''t get it.', '2009-06-20 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537377, 800023, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it... nothing is in focus here, there''s no motion panning that I can see.  It''s not even an interesting abstract.  Sorry, not a fan.</td>', 'I don''t get it... nothing is in focus here, there''s no motion panning that I can see.  It''s not even an interesting abstract.  Sorry, not a fan.', '2009-06-20 12:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537378, 799986, 102019, '<td valign="top">the man is too blurry and the composition is weak.  Had the shot been cropped asymetrically it would have made a difference in drawing more movement into the photo.</td>', 'the man is too blurry and the composition is weak.  Had the shot been cropped asymetrically it would have made a difference in drawing more movement into the photo.', '2009-06-20 12:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537379, 799770, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a very busy shot.  There''s too much going on here. Probably the most interesting part about this photo is the Calvin Klein Ad -- unfortunately, that''s not your art, it''s someone elses.</td>', 'It''s a very busy shot.  There''s too much going on here. Probably the most interesting part about this photo is the Calvin Klein Ad -- unfortunately, that''s not your art, it''s someone elses.', '2009-06-20 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537380, 799538, 102019, '<td valign="top">The ball isn''t completely in focus.  Better lighting on the ball might have made this a more interesting shot.</td>', 'The ball isn''t completely in focus.  Better lighting on the ball might have made this a more interesting shot.', '2009-06-20 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537422, 800028, 102019, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  The horse really stands out from the background, and there''s nothing overly distracting in the shot.  You can really see the movement here.  If I were trying to improve this shot, first I would crop it asymetrically so that I could see more of the area of where the horse was running to and less behind him.  The horse''s face is still just a bit fuzzy around the edges.  I might have bumped up the shutter speed just a tad to see if it improved the focus on his face.</td>', 'I like this photo.  The horse really stands out from the background, and there''s nothing overly distracting in the shot.  You can really see the movement here.  If I were trying to improve this shot, first I would crop it asymetrically so that I could see more of the area of where the horse was running to and less behind him.  The horse''s face is still just a bit fuzzy around the edges.  I might have bumped up the shutter speed just a tad to see if it improved the focus on his face.', '2009-06-20 13:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537430, 798247, 102019, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  While the dog is a stranger to me, I still feel his excitement and enthusiasm of playing with that stick. The way the ears are flapping around, the eyes in focus, the intensity of the green in the blurred background -- well done!</td>', 'I love this shot.  While the dog is a stranger to me, I still feel his excitement and enthusiasm of playing with that stick. The way the ears are flapping around, the eyes in focus, the intensity of the green in the blurred background -- well done!', '2009-06-20 13:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537431, 799910, 102019, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an impressive capture.  I love the clarity in the ball and the racket.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Now that''s an impressive capture.  I love the clarity in the ball and the racket.  Nicely done!', '2009-06-20 13:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537441, 799715, 102019, '<td valign="top">I find the angel of the photograph quite distracting.  It would have been better for me if you hadn''t rotated the shot so severely.</td>', 'I find the angel of the photograph quite distracting.  It would have been better for me if you hadn''t rotated the shot so severely.', '2009-06-20 13:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537442, 799593, 102019, '<td valign="top">Good clear focus on the car.  Well done!  The composition is a bit weak for me though -- i wish I could see more of where the car was headed.  I might not have put the frame at such a strong angel -- it makes me want to turn my head when I am looking at it.</td>', 'Good clear focus on the car.  Well done!  The composition is a bit weak for me though -- i wish I could see more of where the car was headed.  I might not have put the frame at such a strong angel -- it makes me want to turn my head when I am looking at it.', '2009-06-20 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537443, 799912, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that no part of the birds look completely in focus -- it would have been a nice shot otherwise.  If the shutter speed had been bumped ever so slightly, it would have been better for me.</td>', 'It''s a shame that no part of the birds look completely in focus -- it would have been a nice shot otherwise.  If the shutter speed had been bumped ever so slightly, it would have been better for me.', '2009-06-20 13:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537444, 799760, 102019, '<td valign="top">This is much better for me than the flying lenny shot -- Lenny''s whole body is in clear focus this time, and there''s nothing distracting about the background.  It''s a good composition.  The only thing that might have made this shot better for me would be more brilliant or intense colours in the background.</td>', 'This is much better for me than the flying lenny shot -- Lenny''s whole body is in clear focus this time, and there''s nothing distracting about the background.  It''s a good composition.  The only thing that might have made this shot better for me would be more brilliant or intense colours in the background.', '2009-06-20 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537445, 799793, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a weak composition.  The circle in the middle of the frame looks a bit stagnant to me.  I would have liked it better if it were cropped asymetrically</td>', 'It''s a weak composition.  The circle in the middle of the frame looks a bit stagnant to me.  I would have liked it better if it were cropped asymetrically', '2009-06-20 13:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537446, 798332, 102019, '<td valign="top">I find the car and person in the background distracting.  If they weren''t there, it would have been a better composition for me.</td>', 'I find the car and person in the background distracting.  If they weren''t there, it would have been a better composition for me.', '2009-06-20 13:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537448, 799722, 102019, '<td valign="top">I love the colours of this shot.  I am distracted by the white hexagon on the left, and wish that the bird''s head, beak and eye were in focus.</td>', 'I love the colours of this shot.  I am distracted by the white hexagon on the left, and wish that the bird''s head, beak and eye were in focus.', '2009-06-20 13:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537449, 799729, 102019, '<td valign="top">The bird''s feet distract me.  Isn''t it silly! When I look at this, all I see is a big arrow &gt; in the middle of the shot!</td>', 'The bird''s feet distract me.  Isn''t it silly! When I look at this, all I see is a big arrow > in the middle of the shot!', '2009-06-20 13:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537450, 799969, 102019, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot going on in this photo.  It''s too distracting to me.  I would have cropped out the lines on the street -- I don''t think they add anything to the photo.  I also would have cropped the car aysmetrically to one side or the other, and not smack in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'There''s a lot going on in this photo.  It''s too distracting to me.  I would have cropped out the lines on the street -- I don''t think they add anything to the photo.  I also would have cropped the car aysmetrically to one side or the other, and not smack in the middle of the frame.', '2009-06-20 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537451, 800041, 102019, '<td valign="top">Good clear focus on the car. It''s not a bad photograph and technically I can''t find fault with it, but the composition is a bit boring.</td>', 'Good clear focus on the car. It''s not a bad photograph and technically I can''t find fault with it, but the composition is a bit boring.', '2009-06-20 13:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537452, 799943, 102019, '<td valign="top">I am distracted by the fuzzy people in the back seat, and wish that the whole car, as well as all passengers, were in clear focus.</td>', 'I am distracted by the fuzzy people in the back seat, and wish that the whole car, as well as all passengers, were in clear focus.', '2009-06-20 13:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537453, 800029, 102019, '<td valign="top">The bus looks a bit fuzzy around the edges, and the background stands out more than the subject does.  I am distracted by the pretty lights but not really drawn to the subject in any way.  It''s a poor composition for me.</td>', 'The bus looks a bit fuzzy around the edges, and the background stands out more than the subject does.  I am distracted by the pretty lights but not really drawn to the subject in any way.  It''s a poor composition for me.', '2009-06-20 13:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537454, 799154, 102019, '<td valign="top">The bus looks a bit fuzzy around the edges to me - this could just be an illusion from the poor lighting. I wish the bus had better lighting on it.  I do like the colours of the shot.  It''s not a bad photo, but it''s not my favourite in the contest.  Putting the scene on an angel helped the composition for me.</td>', 'The bus looks a bit fuzzy around the edges to me - this could just be an illusion from the poor lighting. I wish the bus had better lighting on it.  I do like the colours of the shot.  It''s not a bad photo, but it''s not my favourite in the contest.  Putting the scene on an angel helped the composition for me.', '2009-06-20 13:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537455, 798266, 102019, '<td valign="top">The car needs to be perfectly clear and in focus, but it''s not, it''s a bit fuzzy around the edges.  The bright white lights (on-coming car headlights, maybe?) is very distracting.  Otherwise, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'The car needs to be perfectly clear and in focus, but it''s not, it''s a bit fuzzy around the edges.  The bright white lights (on-coming car headlights, maybe?) is very distracting.  Otherwise, it''s a nice shot.', '2009-06-20 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537457, 799670, 102019, '<td valign="top">Lenny has a very blurry face.  For this to be an interesting shot for me, his face would have had to be perfectly clear and in focus.</td>', 'Lenny has a very blurry face.  For this to be an interesting shot for me, his face would have had to be perfectly clear and in focus.', '2009-06-20 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537458, 798760, 102019, '<td valign="top">not a fan.  its a bit blurry for me (specifically their helmets and bodies are fuzzy around the edges), and I don''t like looking at people''s backs.</td>', 'not a fan.  its a bit blurry for me (specifically their helmets and bodies are fuzzy around the edges), and I don''t like looking at people''s backs.', '2009-06-20 13:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537459, 799906, 102019, '<td valign="top">The car needs to be spot on, but it''s not. It''s too blurry.</td>', 'The car needs to be spot on, but it''s not. It''s too blurry.', '2009-06-20 13:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537460, 799819, 102019, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been a fan of blurry photos.  And the part that is in focus is me looking at people''s backs.  That doesn''t interest me, sorry.</td>', 'I''ve never been a fan of blurry photos.  And the part that is in focus is me looking at people''s backs.  That doesn''t interest me, sorry.', '2009-06-20 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537461, 799621, 102019, '<td valign="top">your subject is too blurry, and I''m looking at her walking away.  It''s uninteresting, sorry.</td>', 'your subject is too blurry, and I''m looking at her walking away.  It''s uninteresting, sorry.', '2009-06-20 13:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537462, 798657, 102019, '<td valign="top">Your subject is a bit too blurry.  Her face, and glasses are a bit fuzzy.  I might have bumped up the shutter speed a bit more to get more of her in focus.  Also, the shot doesn''t stir any emotion in me and is a dull composition.</td>', 'Your subject is a bit too blurry.  Her face, and glasses are a bit fuzzy.  I might have bumped up the shutter speed a bit more to get more of her in focus.  Also, the shot doesn''t stir any emotion in me and is a dull composition.', '2009-06-20 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537463, 800044, 102019, '<td valign="top">boring.</td>', 'boring.', '2009-06-20 13:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537464, 799580, 102019, '<td valign="top">Good example of motion panning, but boring shot.</td>', 'Good example of motion panning, but boring shot.', '2009-06-20 13:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537465, 799685, 102019, '<td valign="top">There are a couple things that ruin this shot for me: 1) I don''t know this kid. 2) I can''t see the expression on his face, and therefore don''t feel anything emotion towards this stranger.  3)  I''m distracted by the blurry hands and rope.  I might have tried bumping up the shutter speed a bit to try to get more of him in focus.</td>', 'There are a couple things that ruin this shot for me: 1) I don''t know this kid. 2) I can''t see the expression on his face, and therefore don''t feel anything emotion towards this stranger.  3)  I''m distracted by the blurry hands and rope.  I might have tried bumping up the shutter speed a bit to try to get more of him in focus.', '2009-06-20 13:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537466, 799495, 102019, '<td valign="top">your subject is a bit fuzzy.  I also find the background too busy and distracting</td>', 'your subject is a bit fuzzy.  I also find the background too busy and distracting', '2009-06-20 13:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537467, 799861, 102019, '<td valign="top">The girl is very fuzzy around the edges and is too blurry.  Her face and eyes should be completely in focus, but they are not.  Bumping up the shutter speed a bit might have solved this problem.</td>', 'The girl is very fuzzy around the edges and is too blurry.  Her face and eyes should be completely in focus, but they are not.  Bumping up the shutter speed a bit might have solved this problem.', '2009-06-20 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537468, 800036, 102019, '<td valign="top">too busy.  I like the angels of the lines of the road and the fire truck, but I am distracted by the background.  The big shadow of the hydro pole, those lines on the street, the pink thing, whatever that is, all those little bits in the dirt, the spotty shadow of the tree -- it''s all just too much for me.</td>', 'too busy.  I like the angels of the lines of the road and the fire truck, but I am distracted by the background.  The big shadow of the hydro pole, those lines on the street, the pink thing, whatever that is, all those little bits in the dirt, the spotty shadow of the tree -- it''s all just too much for me.', '2009-06-20 13:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537469, 800039, 102019, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the car!  But it''s a boring shot.</td>', 'Good focus on the car!  But it''s a boring shot.', '2009-06-20 13:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537470, 799807, 102019, '<td valign="top">He''s a bit blurry still.</td>', 'He''s a bit blurry still.', '2009-06-20 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537471, 799721, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a little busy.  The angle of the shot makes it interesting, but I don''t like how his shoulder and hat are more in focus than his face.</td>', 'It''s a little busy.  The angle of the shot makes it interesting, but I don''t like how his shoulder and hat are more in focus than his face.', '2009-06-20 13:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537472, 799732, 102019, '<td valign="top">The tractor and person''s body is a bit fuzzy around the edges.  And the background trees and grass is very distracting.</td>', 'The tractor and person''s body is a bit fuzzy around the edges.  And the background trees and grass is very distracting.', '2009-06-20 13:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537473, 799489, 102019, '<td valign="top">I find the sun distracting.  Also, the movement of the shot sugests that we are moving from left to right (or right to left), but the plane is pointing straight at us.  If it is the plane that is moving, shouldn''t it be facing to the left or right of the frame?</td>', 'I find the sun distracting.  Also, the movement of the shot sugests that we are moving from left to right (or right to left), but the plane is pointing straight at us.  If it is the plane that is moving, shouldn''t it be facing to the left or right of the frame?', '2009-06-20 13:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537474, 799468, 102019, '<td valign="top">His face is a bit fuzzy around the edges and the shot is a bit too blurry overall for me.</td>', 'His face is a bit fuzzy around the edges and the shot is a bit too blurry overall for me.', '2009-06-20 13:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537475, 799982, 102019, '<td valign="top">No part of your subject is completely in focus.  It''s a picture of a blurry man waterskiing.</td>', 'No part of your subject is completely in focus.  It''s a picture of a blurry man waterskiing.', '2009-06-20 13:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537476, 799390, 102019, '<td valign="top">awkward composition. The pole in the front of the frame is getting cut off at the top, the heavyness of the buildings at the back aren''t being off-set by anything, the big yellow traffic light in the middle of the picture is distracting, the hydro lines are ugly, the car isn''t really in clear focus nor does it doesn''t stand out from the rest of the backgroud.  This is not an interesting photograph.</td>', 'awkward composition. The pole in the front of the frame is getting cut off at the top, the heavyness of the buildings at the back aren''t being off-set by anything, the big yellow traffic light in the middle of the picture is distracting, the hydro lines are ugly, the car isn''t really in clear focus nor does it doesn''t stand out from the rest of the backgroud.  This is not an interesting photograph.', '2009-06-20 13:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537477, 799892, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a weak composition for me.  I don''t like the car being in the center of the shot.  It would look better if it were off to one side or the other.  Also, the sense of movement I get from this shot is very weak -- the car does not look like it was moving very fast.</td>', 'It''s a weak composition for me.  I don''t like the car being in the center of the shot.  It would look better if it were off to one side or the other.  Also, the sense of movement I get from this shot is very weak -- the car does not look like it was moving very fast.', '2009-06-20 13:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537478, 799327, 102019, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit too blurry for me.  No part of your subject is completely in focus and is a bit fuzzy around the edges.</td>', 'it''s a bit too blurry for me.  No part of your subject is completely in focus and is a bit fuzzy around the edges.', '2009-06-20 13:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537479, 799500, 102019, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything interesting about an empty seat with a shopping bag and whatever that other thing is on the table.  A bowl of fruit?  A hat?  Whatever... who cares?</td>', 'I don''t see anything interesting about an empty seat with a shopping bag and whatever that other thing is on the table.  A bowl of fruit?  A hat?  Whatever... who cares?', '2009-06-20 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537480, 800027, 102019, '<td valign="top">The car and faces are too blurry.</td>', 'The car and faces are too blurry.', '2009-06-20 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537481, 799903, 102019, '<td valign="top">the bike and rider are too blurry.  It would be better if the only thing that was blurry was the background and the spokes of the wheels, but the most important part of the shot -- the head and eyes of the rider, are not in focus.</td>', 'the bike and rider are too blurry.  It would be better if the only thing that was blurry was the background and the spokes of the wheels, but the most important part of the shot -- the head and eyes of the rider, are not in focus.', '2009-06-20 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537482, 799998, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s very dark.  A gloomy, uninteresting shot.</td>', 'It''s very dark.  A gloomy, uninteresting shot.', '2009-06-20 13:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537694, 799937, 51747, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool image. Not sure that it meets the challenge. You have the Jelly in the foreground sharp  and the others in the background are out of focus. This just looks like selective focus. I''ll give you a 6 just because I like the color and luminescence of it.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool image. Not sure that it meets the challenge. You have the Jelly in the foreground sharp  and the others in the background are out of focus. This just looks like selective focus. I''ll give you a 6 just because I like the color and luminescence of it.', '2009-06-20 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537698, 799779, 51747, '<td valign="top">I''m not going to vote on this because I can''t make out what''s going on. I may just be blind</td>', 'I''m not going to vote on this because I can''t make out what''s going on. I may just be blind', '2009-06-20 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
