(5542517, 799383, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>dazzling, dynamic, disorienting, intriguing--super job!!</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!dazzling, dynamic, disorienting, intriguing--super job!!', '2009-06-24 14:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5542525, 799538, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>I love this image!  The net and the court surface echo each other in fractured form, with a small, similar element on the ball itself.  The hoop and the ball share the dark circular forms, and the shooter anchors the corner.  Very Well Done.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!I love this image!  The net and the court surface echo each other in fractured form, with a small, similar element on the ball itself.  The hoop and the ball share the dark circular forms, and the shooter anchors the corner.  Very Well Done.', '2009-06-24 14:44:58.000000', NULL, 0),
