(5542564, 799643, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man!  This is awesome!  Not only flawless in its technical quality -- but has that added factor that tugs on and mushes up your heart strings.  Congratulations!!</td>', 'Oh man!  This is awesome!  Not only flawless in its technical quality -- but has that added factor that tugs on and mushes up your heart strings.  Congratulations!!', '2009-06-24 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 0),
