(5542663, 799807, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice shot will - a couple of comments about your opinion that selective desat cost you score.  I think there are a couple of other reasons that some may voted you down -  the crop seems a bit tight on the top of the head and the brickwork seems to prevent the shot from really seeing the motion - if that makes sense.   Also, some voters hate borders of any type and your choice of the yellow piping there just adds to it.<br/> <br/>Personally, I like the shot and would have given you a 6 or 7 if I ended up voting.  Cheers!</td>', 'nice shot will - a couple of comments about your opinion that selective desat cost you score.  I think there are a couple of other reasons that some may voted you down -  the crop seems a bit tight on the top of the head and the brickwork seems to prevent the shot from really seeing the motion - if that makes sense.   Also, some voters hate borders of any type and your choice of the yellow piping there just adds to it. Personally, I like the shot and would have given you a 6 or 7 if I ended up voting.  Cheers!', '2009-06-24 17:01:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5542719, 799905, 83181, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, and many positive ones to :D <br/> <br/>I made this shot, by standing behind my girlfriend who''s holding little David. the location is on a little playground nearby, on a spinable plate about 1 meter in diameter and some metalpipes where mounted for holding on to. it was very difficult to make it look like I was holding the baby, and he was not all cooperative ( why I only had a few shots to make it right )<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, and many positive ones to :D  I made this shot, by standing behind my girlfriend who''s holding little David. the location is on a little playground nearby, on a spinable plate about 1 meter in diameter and some metalpipes where mounted for holding on to. it was very difficult to make it look like I was holding the baby, and he was not all cooperative ( why I only had a few shots to make it right )', '2009-06-24 17:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
