(5745570, 800029, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think you did an excellent job on the motion panning. I would just have liked to seen more of the bus. I''m surprised by the score.</td>', 'I think you did an excellent job on the motion panning. I would just have liked to seen more of the bus. I''m surprised by the score.', '2009-11-29 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5839311, 799113, 39880, '<td valign="top">Here''s what I think.  I would have given this a 6.  Technically it looks good.  But kind of static.  A different angle on the car would have been nice.  Maybe catch it in a turn.  The sign in the background is a bit distracting.  Some blue sky and the green hills would have been nice with the red car.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'Here''s what I think.  I would have given this a 6.  Technically it looks good.  But kind of static.  A different angle on the car would have been nice.  Maybe catch it in a turn.  The sign in the background is a bit distracting.  Some blue sky and the green hills would have been nice with the red car.  Hope that helps.', '2010-01-27 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5850411, 799113, 79141, '<td valign="top">G''day dave <br/>a great stop action capture<br/>the blurred background just looks a little much it does tend to over ride the image  <br/>the colors of the car are fantastic  and i do agree that if  you had caught it moving into or out of a corner it would have added a more dramatic feel to the whole image<br/> <br/>if i had voted  on this it would have defionately got a 6 from me as well</td>', 'G''day dave a great stop action capturethe blurred background just looks a little much it does tend to over ride the image  the colors of the car are fantastic  and i do agree that if  you had caught it moving into or out of a corner it would have added a more dramatic feel to the whole image if i had voted  on this it would have defionately got a 6 from me as well', '2010-02-03 06:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
